From: WAKATA dev <dev@wakata.local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:49:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Module 2: admin and account shells (layouts, sidebar/topbar
 includes, static views)

- layouts/admin, admin-auth, account, account-auth with head/sidebar/topbar/scripts partials
- 47 Blade views converted from the prototype HTML; modals via @stack('modals')
- routes/admin.php and routes/account.php, legacy .html links redirect
- @icon directive + config/icons.php
- assets moved to public/assets/admin and public/assets/account
- public sign-in dropdown uses the new routes
- fix: data.js no longer wipes WK globals; shop views no longer glue @endsection to text (data-page was empty)
- tests: ShellRoutesTest
